{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The chat's session index — list and delete. Resolves the session's user server-side from nn_sessionid and folds that user's append-only index (runtime/agent/chat/<user>.jsonl) into [{id,title,time}] newest-first; op=delete appends a {id,deleted:true} tombstone and returns the folded list. The session records themselves live in the store and are read/written through the platform's gated paths (app.read / app.write); this command owns only the per-user index file. Admin-gated.\n\nInputs:\n- `op` (*string*): list | delete.\n- `id` (*string*): Session id — required for delete, ignored for list (pass empty string).\n- `nn_sessionid` (*string*): Auto-injected request metadata; resolves the user. Pass null from javascript.","import":"use ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;","params":[{"desc":"list returns the folded [{id,title,time}] newest-first; delete appends a {id,deleted:true} tombstone and returns the folded list.","name":"op","type":"String"},{"desc":"Session id — required for delete, ignored for list (pass an empty string).","name":"id","type":"String"},{"desc":"Request metadata auto-injected by the framework; resolves the session's user server-side. Pass null from javascript.","name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"kjntuo1a0f6c2de8br7e4","readers":[],"time":1790846468338,"username":"system","writers":[]}